OL,3,GNEWSAPub chain drops bid to serve      
OL,4,Achildren after backlash                
OL,6,FA pub chain in Edinburgh has dropped   
OL,7,Fits bid for a licence to serve         
OL,8,Funaccompanied 12 to 15-year-olds after 
OL,9,Fa public backlash.                     
OL,11,FSignature Pubs Limited asked the       
OL,12,Fcouncil last month to approve plans    
OL,13,Fthat would let teenagers enter the     
OL,14,Fpremises alone or in groups of up to   
OL,15,Fsix to buy a meal, snack or soft drink.
OL,17,FCouncillors planned to carry out a site
OL,18,Fvisit after raising concerns about how 
OL,19,Fthe company would deal with "feral"    
OL,20,Fbehaviour from teenagers.              
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
