OL,3,GNEWSAPub chain drops bid to serve      
OL,4,Achildren after backlash                
OL,6,FSignature's business development       
OL,7,Fdirector Louise MacLean has told BBC   
OL,8,FScotland the company has withdrawn the 
OL,9,Fapplications for the licenses, just    
OL,10,Fdays before councillors were meant to  
OL,11,Fdecide on the issue.                   
